# Appearance review captures. The three compare--*.png sheets ARE committed:
# they carry the measured contrast result and are the record of why the
# transparency line falls where it does. The per-theme grids beside them are
# review artifacts, superseded by the next design change, and 19MB of PNG that
# git would keep forever.
